      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's completely understandable that you feel exhausted when facing such a deep sense of loss, and sometimes the pressure to \"fix\" things feels unbearable. If the usual routes feel like noise, perhaps it's time to look at gentler ways to acknowledge this fading feeling rather than fighting it. Allowing yourself to rest from the struggle, even if it feels like giving up, can sometimes be the first step toward finding a different kind of peace.",
      "source": "target",
